# <scope>: <description>
#
# [optional body: what changed and why, wrapped at 72]
#
# Scope is the area changed, e.g. tui, cli, hosts, backup, config, audit,
# platform, docs, ci, build, release. Separate several with commas
# (build,ci: ...), or use treewide for changes across the whole tree.
#
# Release notes are generated from commit subjects, so write the subject
# as a user-readable summary of the change.
#
# Examples:
# hosts: read back category names that contain hyphens
# cli: print a command's help when it is used wrongly
# build,ci,release: replace the pipeline with GoReleaser
